# Official Journal snapshots are records, not code: keep them out of the
# language statistics and collapse them in diffs.
# -text: the files are byte-exact and their SHA-256 is tested, so no checkout may convert
# line endings (core.autocrlf would otherwise rewrite LF to CRLF on Windows).
sources/**/*.xhtml -text linguist-vendored linguist-generated
sources/manifest.json -text
